Eliminate toDataURL bottleneck and overhaul interaction performance

- Replace per-cell canvas.toDataURL() with CSS background-position for
  both Fill and Fit modes, removing the #1 rendering bottleneck entirely
- Switch scatter cell positioning from left/top (triggers Layout) to
  CSS transform: translate() (compositor-only, GPU-accelerated)
- Coalesce layout updates via requestAnimationFrame to prevent redundant
  style passes from multiple pointermove events per frame
- Add contain: strict and will-change: transform on grid/freestyle cells
  for layout isolation and GPU layer promotion
- Unify transform ownership: resize, drag, and knob updates all write
  through _updateFreestyleCellStyles() via data-x/data-y offsets,
  fixing the Radius vs Width/Height cross-reset bug
- Move scheduleSidebarUpdate back into onChange to fix knob snap-back
- Clear _freestyleCellsJustRebuilt in scheduleRender to prevent stale
  full re-renders after Chaos changes

